{"id": "919d0a0e860ace9311589e6029bae535", "text": "the scriptures apply to living beings who can perform activities based on \nthe material strength and powers granted to them by the Lord.  If the Lord \nas the independent doer is responsible for  all activities, what is the role of \nliving beings? Living beings have an intrinsic intent ( iccha ) to achieve \nsalvation which leads them to make attempt s (prayatna ). By the grace of \nthe Lord, they are given the ability to perform actions. Hence, living bei ngs \nare responsible for their actions.", "embedding": [-0.06221267580986023, 0.04181067645549774, -0.04790901765227318, 0.04019623249769211, 0.01210067979991436, 0.04383695870637894, 0.06734168529510498, -0.08981639891862869, 0.03838185593485832, 0.08736709505319595, 0.02527356892824173, -0.08883160352706909, -0.034230366349220276, 0.08516296744346619, 0.054917287081480026, -0.05718386545777321, -0.0921567976474762, -0.03494018316268921, -0.07617753744125366, 0.006843465846031904, -0.011597072705626488, 0.013916736468672752, 0.010926694609224796, -0.026300249621272087, -0.05849578604102135, 0.0006550179678015411, 0.017513608559966087, -0.1026122123003006, 0.07339222729206085, -0.04391485080122948, 0.08136769384145737, -0.0712382048368454, 0.04862518981099129, -0.050538692623376846, -0.16116668283939362, 0.11942839622497559, 0.07015373557806015, -0.03390428051352501, -0.04426415264606476, -0.040298499166965485, 0.04257678613066673, 0.007935421541333199, -0.04047756269574165, -0.09949997812509537, 0.0004172415065113455, -0.019662514328956604, -0.06599485129117966, -0.02954195998609066, -0.04650062322616577, -0.04683858901262283, -0.03825122490525246, -0.011829091235995293, -0.008744207210838795, 0.09048653393983841, -0.03260278329253197, -0.00959580298513174, 0.0020934983622282743, -0.039297573268413544, 0.08249225467443466, -0.06797464936971664, 0.03524443879723549, -0.0022932805586606264, 0.05957479029893875, 0.04721352830529213, 0.03104058839380741, -0.03140